<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <h1 class="mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
        Welcome to <strong>WanderLust</strong>. Your privacy is important to us.
        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information while you use our platform.
    </p>
    <h4>Information We Collect</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>Name and email address during registration.</li>
        <li>Listing details and images uploaded by users.</li>
        <li>Reviews and ratings submitted by users.</li>
        <li>Location information used for displaying maps.</li>
    </ul>
    <h4>How We Use Your Information</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>To provide and improve our services.</li>
        <li>To manage user accounts and listings.</li>
        <li>To display listing locations on maps.</li>
        <li>To ensure platform security.</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Data Security</h4>
    <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect your information.
        However, no method of transmission over the Internet is completely secure.
    </p>

    <h4>Third-Party Services</h4>

    <p>
        WanderLust uses third-party services including Cloudinary for image storage
        and OpenStreetMap for displaying maps.
    </p>
    <h4>Contact Us</h4>
    <p>
        If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy,
        please contact us through the information provided on our website.
    </p>
    <p class="text-muted mt-4">
        Last Updated: July 2026
    </p>
</div>